# Wave W17-H (Route 37): old podnut — the old twin podnut tree of the road’s marking pair: two trunks, a heavier crown than Route 29’s young podnut, round ripe pods hanging in it, on pod turf (ground baked in). The sign’s twin trees, grown old.
